  "label": "진술 테스트",
  "nodes": [],
  "statement_nodes": [
    {
      "speaker": "235db733-cbb2-4c89-86fc-377149f9de48",
      "text": "안녕하세요. 이곳에서는 진술에서 거짓을 발견할 수 있는 시스템이 준비되어 있답니다.",
      "stage_cast": {
        "235db733-cbb2-4c89-86fc-377149f9de48": {
          "portrait": "default",
          "animation_order": 1,
          "portrait_zoom": 300,
          "animation_speed": 1,
          "portrait_opacity": 1,
          "portrait_position": "center"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "235db733-cbb2-4c89-86fc-377149f9de48",
      "text": "거짓말을 하는 캐릭터는 그 안에 동요가 숨어있을 수 있어요.",
      "stage_cast": {
        "235db733-cbb2-4c89-86fc-377149f9de48": {
          "portrait": "default",
          "animation_order": 1,
          "portrait_zoom": 300,
          "animation_speed": 1,
          "portrait_opacity": 1,
          "portrait_position": "center"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "235db733-cbb2-4c89-86fc-377149f9de48",
      "text": "예시를 들어 볼게요.",
      "stage_cast": {
        "235db733-cbb2-4c89-86fc-377149f9de48": {
          "portrait": "default",
          "animation_order": 1,
          "portrait_zoom": 300,
          "animation_speed": 1,
          "portrait_opacity": 1,
          "portrait_position": "center"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "235db733-cbb2-4c89-86fc-377149f9de48",
      "text": "저는 지난밤에 몰래 [lie][speed=1.8]케이크를 먹지 않았어요[/speed][/lie].",
      "statement_lies": [
        {
          "id": "lie_0",
          "phrase": "케이크를 먹지 않았어요",
          "reactions": [
            {
              "kind": "default",
              "label": "잘못된 연결",
              "nodes": [
                {
                  "speaker": "235db733-cbb2-4c89-86fc-377149f9de48",
                  "text": "잘못된 정보를 선택한거 같아요!",
                  "stage_cast": {
                    "235db733-cbb2-4c89-86fc-377149f9de48": {
                      "portrait": "default",
                      "animation_order": 1,
                      "portrait_zoom": 300,
                      "animation_speed": 1,
                      "portrait_opacity": 1,
                      "portrait_position": "center"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "speaker": "narrator",
                  "text": "(이건 아닌가 보군. 다시한번 생각해 보자.)",
                  "stage_cast": {
                    "235db733-cbb2-4c89-86fc-377149f9de48": {
                      "portrait": "default",
                      "animation_order": 1,
                      "portrait_zoom": 300,
                      "animation_speed": 1,
                      "portrait_opacity": 1,
                      "portrait_position": "center"
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "item",
              "target_id": "b8e1d4b1-9f68-4048-92b9-7180ab5cda5c",
              "statement_end": true,
              "nodes": [
                {
                  "speaker": "235db733-cbb2-4c89-86fc-377149f9de48",
                  "text": "좋아요. 들켰군요.",
                  "stage_cast": {
                    "235db733-cbb2-4c89-86fc-377149f9de48": {
                      "portrait": "default",
                      "animation_order": 1,
                      "portrait_zoom": 300,
                      "animation_speed": 1,
                      "portrait_opacity": 1,
                      "portrait_position": "center"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "speaker": "narrator",
                  "text": "(뭐가 그리 당당한 건데...)",
                  "stage_cast": {
                    "235db733-cbb2-4c89-86fc-377149f9de48": {
                      "portrait": "default",
                      "animation_order": 1,
                      "portrait_zoom": 300,
                      "animation_speed": 1,
                      "portrait_opacity": 1,
                      "portrait_position": "center"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "speaker": "235db733-cbb2-4c89-86fc-377149f9de48",
                  "text": "[wave amp=28.0 freq=5.0 connected=1]그런데~~[/wave]| 사실은 제가 어제 저녁에 먹은건 케이크가 아니라 푸딩이었답니다~",
                  "stage_cast": {
                    "235db733-cbb2-4c89-86fc-377149f9de48": {
                      "portrait": "happy",
                      "animation_order": 1,
                      "portrait_zoom": 300,
                      "animation_speed": 1,
                      "portrait_opacity": 1,
                      "portrait_position": "center"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "speaker": "235db733-cbb2-4c89-86fc-377149f9de48",
                  "text": "뭐. 그건 아무래도 상관 없지만요.",
                  "stage_cast": {
                    "235db733-cbb2-4c89-86fc-377149f9de48": {
                      "portrait": "default",
                      "animation_order": 1,
                      "portrait_zoom": 300,
                      "animation_speed": 1,
                      "portrait_opacity": 1,
                      "portrait_position": "center"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "speaker": "235db733-cbb2-4c89-86fc-377149f9de48",
                  "text": "이상으로 테스트를 종료하겠습니다~",
                  "stage_cast": {
                    "235db733-cbb2-4c89-86fc-377149f9de48": {
                      "portrait": "default",
                      "animation_order": 1,
                      "portrait_zoom": 300,
                      "animation_speed": 1,
                      "portrait_opacity": 1,
                      "portrait_position": "center"
